674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dE8Lz8pS4ZYQ7kNvwGAiVwF&_nc_oc=Adr-ZEpZQQNWH6NtKPsR5WedbrvZBgJmDojrfBd8R5Ea4OiW6ikDkI-YRs_jXyMkTTM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBgWkkUE_VrCSQicTCxoENEJl_moLK1gyi6DoS7NoIoVg&oe=6A53A559"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZOTCmm8xdOUQ7kNvwF9uhVw&_nc_oc=AdqTn45xOJ5c6QBeXzAW-vsAiIn42dwWDw_di2rmTz9lTvt8a_o5GRVvFh-sK64zP6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBymNdX6uoE7E2NHTzTXis4ibqO5FxWkM6sbs1bbO1daA&oe=6A53AE16"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9vsOi28KxBEQ7kNvwFfgGGN&_nc_oc=Adr2w7HU6FALZ2KiQbHXQtZOOYusFkyrRWBSAd8Q1vbler73AgNtsnxTL8z17IUjafk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDkMcHslX249pIidn9uJP0jJ_mueeQpDmmvzAYv3uO_Xg&oe=6A53AA31"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip